<%# The league's defining controversy. Stated plainly, respectfully, once — the
    joke is the disputed trophy, never the event (history-chronicle-voice.md §8.4). %>
<div class="asterisk-note" id="asterisk">
  <h4>* The 2022 Asterisk</h4>
  <p>The 2022 title is shared — <b>Marian and Sam</b> split first and second — and
  the league has disputed it ever since. In the final week the Bills–Bengals game
  was cancelled after <b>Damar Hamlin's on-field cardiac arrest</b>. Marian was
  losing; the game vanished; the two agreed to divide the top two prizes rather
  than settle it on a half-played week.</p>
  <p>It is the league's LeBron-bubble-ring argument — a ring in the record book
  with a footnote welded to it. The asterisk stays wherever that title is listed.</p>
</div>
